QuestGuidance.Register("en",256,{
[8161]="70024815\n1\tDeliver the albino fur to Kaleva at Sûri-kylä in Forochel\030Collect albino fur (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver albino fur from the beasts surrounding Sûri-kylä in Forochel. The items are to be delivered to Kaleva at the Lossoth capital.\n",
[8162]="700247EF\n1\tDeliver the albino skin to Kaleva at Sûri-kylä in Forochel\030Collect albino skin (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver albino skin from the beasts and worms surrounding Sûri-kylä in Forochel. The items are to be delivered to Kaleva at the Lossoth capital.\n",
[8163]="700247FE\n1\tDeliver the bright dust to Santtu at Kauppa-kohta in Forochel\030Collect bright dust (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver bright dust from the fell spirits in the areas surrounding Kauppa-khota to Santtu, a Lossoth watching over the outpost.\n",
[8164]="700247D6\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Santtu at Kauppa-kohta\030Collect broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken great swords from the sentient creatures in the woods surrounding Kauppa-khota and the frozen valleys to the north to Santtu, a Lossoth watching over the outpost.\n",
[8165]="70024808\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Lauri at Pynti-peldot in Forochel\030Collect broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken great swords from the Gauredain surrounding the encampment of Pynti-peldot to Lauri, a Lossoth-scout.\n",
[8166]="70024803\n1\tDeliver the broken wooden clubs to Kaleva at Sûri-kylä in Forochel\030Collect broken wooden clubs (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken wooden clubs from the Angmarim invaders surrounding Sûri-kylä in Forochel. The items are to be delivered to Kaleva at the Lossoth capital.\n",
[8167]="70024809\n1\tDeliver the gilded sword sheaths to Lauri at Pynti-peldot in Forochel\030Collect gilded sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver gilded sword sheaths from the Gauredain surrounding the encampment of Pynti-peldot to Lauri, a Lossoth-scout.\n",
