[8169]="700247DC\n1\tDeliver the great filth to Santtu at Kauppa-kohta in Forochel\030Collect great filth (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver great filth from the fell spirits in the areas surrounding Kauppa-khota to Santtu, a Lossoth watching over the outpost.\n",
