[8175]="700247FF\n1\tDeliver the pure black skin to Santtu at Kauppa-kohta in Forochel\030Collect pure black skin (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver pure black skin from the beasts in the woods surrounding Kauppa-khota to Santtu, a Lossoth watching over the outpost.\n",
