[8177]="7002724C\n1\tDefeat crebain in the South Gravenwood (total: 10)\tCrebain can be found throughout the South Gravenwood. Andreg wants your help hunting crebain to rid the world of some of Saruman's spies.\n2\tTalk to Andreg\tYou should speak with Andreg about your successes against the crebain of the South Gravenwood.\n",
[8178]="70009A5B\n1\tFind the small lead dog\tThe Barandalf is north and slightly east of Dwaling. Ronald has asked you to search the banks of the Brandywine in the Sand-marshes to find his son's lost toy. He has told you that one of the burrowing insects may have taken it.\n2\tBring the toy dog to Ronald Dwale\tRonald Dwale is at Hob Hillbrow's home at the Bullroarer's Sward in Dwaling, south of Barandalf. You should return the toy dog to Ronald Dwale.\n",
[8179]="70015220\n1\tFind Flík\tFlík is probably in a camp not far from the road leading through the Silvertine Lodes. The dwarf Flík has gone missing from the expedition, and you have been asked to find him, for he is the son of an important dwarf. If Flík cannot be found, Styrr will be in a great deal of trouble for allowing harm to come to him.\n",
[8180]="7002EF3E\n1\tFind Langmanu and show him the way back to camp\030Find Swithlic and show him the way back to camp\tLangmanu and Swithlic have not been seen since the Orc-attack, and Radwulf is worried about them. He thinks that they will seek out the streams or waterfalls in the East Wall and wants you to look for his friends.\n2\tTalk to Radwulf\tRadwulf is in the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall. You found Langmanu and Swithlic by the streams that run through the East Wall and should return to Radwulf at the Rohirrim-camp. You wonder whether you should ask him why he left out the fact that they were horses.\n",
[8181]="70015E39\n1\tTake the satchel to Gwingris\tGwingris lies to the west of the ruined supply delivery. You should take the satchel you found to the Elf-camp at Gwingris.\n",
[8182]="7006B88C\n1\tCollect lost supplies in Maurûsh (total: 6)\tGather the lost supplies for Galâmka from within Maurûsh.\n2\tDeliver the lost supplies to Galâmka\tDeliver the recovered supplies to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh.\n",
[8183]="700700C5\n1\tFind lost hobbits (total: 4)\tCamelia has asked you to find the lost hobbits and return them to the surface. Or at least what is left of them.\n2\tTalk to Camelia Buttonbloom\tYou have found all four lost hobbits and given them directions back to the tunnel entrance. You should return to Camelia Buttonbloom just outside of the cave, south-east of the Staddle village centre.\n",
[8184]="7002AC2B\n1\tOpen envelopes you find to collect invitations (total: 6)\tThe envelopes are scattered around Bree. Percy Bywood has asked you to look inside envelopes scattered around town return to him any invitations you find.\n2\tBring the invitations to Percy Bywood in Bree\tPercy Bywood is near the Boar-fountain in Bree. You should return the invitations you found to Percy Bywood.\n",
[8185]="70058CF3\n1\tCollect Angmarim scrolls in Tûr Ágal (total: 8)\030Collect Angmarim tomes in Tûr Ágal (total: 3)\tAngmarim scrolls and tomes can be found in the tower, Tûr Ágal, at Caivád Sâr. Múta has asked you to collect Angmarim scrolls and tomes from the forces of the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr.\n2\tDeliver the Angmarim scrolls and tomes to Múta\tMúta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade. You have collected many tomes and scrolls from the forces of the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr. You should deliver them to Múta.\n",
[8186]="70048B11\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\tBlood-stained pages can be found scattered around Agarnaith. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[8187]="70048B13\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\tShadowed pages can be found scattered around Dor Amarth. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8188]="70048B12\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\030Collect Page 16\030Collect Page 17\030Collect Page 18\030Collect Page 19\tWeb-covered pages can be found scattered around Lhingris. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8189]="7004BCE2\n1\tGather Ash-worn Pages\tGather Ash-worn Pages.\n2\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\tAsh-worn Pages can be found scattered around Dor Amarth. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n3\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8190]="70048B14\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\030Collect Page 11\030Collect Page 12\030Collect Page 13\030Collect Page 14\030Collect Page 15\tSinged Pages can be found scattered around Talath Úrui. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[8191]="7004BD3A\n1\tCollect pages of lost lore in the Abyss of Mordath\t\n2\tFind the first page\030Find the second page\030Find the third page\030Find the fourth page\030Find the fifth page\030Find the sixth page\030Find the seventh page\030Find the eighth page\030Find the ninth page\030Find the tenth page\030Find the eleventh page\tForgotten pages can be found within the Abyss of Mordath. You should find the pages to learn more of the lost lore of the Mordath: the Black Pits of Mordor.\n3\tYou have gathered all the pages of the lost lore of the Black Pits within the Abyss of Mordath.\t\n",
[8192]="7004C031\n1\tCollect Page 1\030Collect Page 2\030Collect Page 3\030Collect Page 4\030Collect Page 5\030Collect Page 6\030Collect Page 7\030Collect Page 8\030Collect Page 9\030Collect Page 10\tBlood-ink Pages can be found inside the Court of Seregost. You should collect the pages to complete the story.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
